      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Detached four bedroom bungalow.\r\nSpacious and well proportioned accommodation.\r\nGenerous surrounding gardens.\r\nBenefitting from a detached garage on site.\r\nLocated approximately 10km from Abbeyfeale and 34km from Tralee.\r\nExtending to approximately 137 sq. m (1,475 sq. ft).\r\nOn a site area extending to approximately 1.59 hectares (3.92 acres).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a detached four buungalow house with gardens to the front and rear. The property is arranged over ground and one upper floor beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 137 sq. m (1,475 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
      },
